{"id":"16","title":"16","image":"images/16.jpg","width":1240,"height":2000,"blocks":[{"text":"- 57 -","lines":1,"cx":544,"cy":38.5,"w":120,"h":24,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(218, 218, 218)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"- 57 -"}},{"text":"черной доске пишут белым мелом. На белой бумаге пишут черным карандашом. В маленькой комнате четыре окна. В маленькой комнате окна маленькие и узкие. В большой комнате окна и двери большие и широкие. На правой стене часы. На левой стене карты и диаграммы. Этот человек очень стар. Тот человек очень молод Молодые работают много. Старые работают мало. Перед столом два стула. На одном стуле сидит учитель.","lines":8,"cx":528,"cy":229,"w":984,"h":273,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(229, 229, 229)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"They write with white chalk on the blackboard. They write with black pencil on white paper. There are four windows in the small room. In the small room, the windows are small and narrow. In the large room, the windows and doors are large and wide. On the right wall, there is a clock. On the left wall, there are maps and diagrams. This man is very old. That man is very young. The young work a lot. The old work little. There are two chairs in front of the table. The teacher sits on one of the chairs."}},{"text":"23 nco dəres.","lines":1,"cx":534,"cy":437.5,"w":250,"h":40,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(248, 248, 248)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"23 years old."}},{"text":"Bez xazer narsalar BelǝBez.","lines":1,"cx":541.5,"cy":496,"w":511,"h":38,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(253, 253, 253)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Bez Khazar things BelǝBez."}},{"text":"Bez xozer tatarca jazz, вы həm ber az sejliBez.","lines":2,"cx":525.5,"cy":586,"w":992,"h":105,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(248, 248, 248)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"No more Tatar jazz, you're also a little bit of a sejli."}},{"text":"Xazer Bez Bik kyp soravlaroja çavaplar da Birǝ- bez, menga xətle sanj, Ber az figellǝrne də BelaBez. Ul fiogellər bolaj yzgərələr:","lines":3,"cx":525,"cy":736,"w":997,"h":168,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(244, 244, 244)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Khazer Bez Many questions are answered by Birɑ- bez, I am not mistaken, Give some figs to BelaBez. The figs will be changed:"}},{"text":"JAZ","lines":1,"cx":268.5,"cy":842.5,"w":49,"h":21,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(198, 198, 198)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"ME"}},{"text":"I jaza","lines":1,"cx":244,"cy":927.5,"w":77.1,"h":24,"angle":-2.2,"bg":"rgb(179, 179, 179)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"And the gap"}},{"text":"дь","lines":1,"cx":818.5,"cy":849,"w":36,"h":27,"angle":1.6,"bg":"rgb(248, 248, 248)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"d"}},{"text":"едь |","lines":1,"cx":842,"cy":931.5,"w":90,"h":28,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(252, 252, 252)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"eat |"}},{"text":"Jazam","lines":1,"cx":143,"cy":1134.5,"w":62,"h":14,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(163, 163, 163)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Jazz"}},{"text":"uqujm","lines":1,"cx":686,"cy":1135.5,"w":66,"h":23,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(188, 188, 188)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"sleep"}},{"text":"даганы","lines":1,"cx":375,"cy":1145,"w":70,"h":19,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(227, 227, 227)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"the other"}},{"text":"jaza-z","lines":1,"cx":259.5,"cy":1254.5,"w":79,"h":18,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(192, 192, 192)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"me-with"}},{"text":"jazalar","lines":1,"cx":411,"cy":1256.5,"w":72,"h":22,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(194, 194, 194)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"punishments"}},{"text":"EŞLƏ","lines":1,"cx":524.5,"cy":1357.5,"w":99,"h":35,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(246, 246, 246)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"COUPLE"}},{"text":"eşli","lines":1,"cx":525.5,"cy":1481,"w":46,"h":29,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(240, 240, 240)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"spouse"}},{"text":"кувь","lines":1,"cx":647,"cy":1254,"w":50,"h":24,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(232, 232, 232)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"kuvy"}},{"text":"bjbz","lines":1,"cx":811.5,"cy":1258.5,"w":57,"h":17,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(233, 233, 233)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"bjbz"}},{"text":"eslim","lines":1,"cx":386,"cy":1685.5,"w":64,"h":27,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(211, 211, 211)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"I remember"}},{"text":"eşlisen","lines":1,"cx":654,"cy":1691,"w":88,"h":31,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(247, 247, 247)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"your partner"}},{"text":"eşlinez","lines":1,"cx":292.5,"cy":1876.5,"w":85,"h":29,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(173, 173, 173)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"I am thin."}},{"text":"eslisez.","lines":1,"cx":519,"cy":1881,"w":86,"h":34,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(211, 211, 211)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Choose."}},{"text":"eşlilər","lines":1,"cx":751.5,"cy":1880,"w":81,"h":31,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(249, 249, 249)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"spouses"}}]}